    <h2>What I collect</h2>
    <p>If you sign up, your email address, plus whether you open or click my emails. Visit counts on the site are anonymous and use no cookies.</p>
    <h2>Why</h2>
    <p>To send you new videos and the occasional note from me, and to see which ones help.</p>
    <h2>Who handles it</h2>
    <p>The site is hosted on Cloudflare, which also counts visits anonymously. My email list runs on Kit, which stores your address and tracks opens and clicks. Videos play from Bunny Stream, which collects anonymous playback data and saves where you stopped in your browser's local storage so you can pick up where you left off. Memberships run on Patreon and purchases on Lemon Squeezy, so if you join or buy, they handle your payment details, not me.</p>
